#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:5 3831141a04ca40f89ee8d84bf7115328
#: 488fd3e49b3049518611e7450ba31c0a a8a55befc7d24801aa92665c62f2302c
#: e45d6798a0594fcab41d8a3419753b8a
msgid "CEE-LINE Single-Beam Echosounder"
msgstr "CEE-LINE 单波束回声测深仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:7 0364809b91b0468db006dd0e2ed9ab50
#: 5628ed1abd1145fa8abfb01b579b9e93 a2df38274aaf415c928bc9c705bccc88
#: c87551b49d3248b98f9ba8c1adf1f669
msgid ""
"The `CEE-LINE single-beam echosounder "
"<https://ceehydrosystems.com/products/single-beam-echo-sounders/cee-"
"line/>`__ can be connected to the autopilot allowing high-resolution, high-"
"reliabiltiy depth data to be obtained live."
msgstr ""
"`CEE-LINE 单波束回声测深仪 <https://ceehydrosystems.com/products/single-beam-echo-"
"sounders/cee-line/>`__ 可以连接到飞控，实时获取高分辨率、高可靠性的水深数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:13 0d9bd86f558c4d53be229a19f55f7885
#: 2e4acdab74d04eceaa900dd73467f394 42c11438f94f4a92ad9d13181d321472
#: 6f5f8dc0cd054ce6b971d5244775784d
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr "硬件设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:15 0146dc7735854070b5acf3db1f4c56a1
#: 0af95d4d4af843eb88187e37ae01e58f 38a20c2aeb084ae28442415b866f5cf3
#: b68ab200019a4bebb8a52f21fad2aa60
msgid ""
"A standard CEE-LINE kit contains a USB cable.  To work with ardupilot you "
"will need to purchase a CEE-LINE ardupilot cable, available from `CEE "
"HydroSystems <https://ceehydrosystems.com/>`__.  Connect the CEE-LINE "
"ardupilot cable to one of the serial ports (in this example we use Telem2)."
"  The CEE-LINE ardupilot cable is built specifically to connect to telemetry"
" ports and it should not be possible to plug it in incorrectly.  The CEE-"
"LINE will be powered from the Telem2 port, no further connections are "
"required."
msgstr ""
"标准 CEE-LINE 套件包含一根 USB 线。要与 ArduPilot 配合使用，需要向 `CEE HydroSystems "
"<https://ceehydrosystems.com/>`__ 购买 CEE-LINE ardupilot 线缆。将 CEE-LINE "
"ardupilot 线缆连接到某个串口（本例使用 Telem2）。CEE-LINE ardupilot "
"线缆专为连接数传端口而制作，应该不可能插错。CEE-LINE 由 Telem2 端口供电，无需其他连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:17 5bffe024632e44df94460f21ab4800a0
#: 603950118cb9465bbdb5d158ead064c5 729f6f3a151f42f7a06c425c69ff671c
#: e0578b9a2b0a4581a07a917d1f69a015
msgid "The CEE-LINE is small and can fit into even very small boats."
msgstr "CEE-LINE 体积小巧，即使非常小的船也能装下。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:23 0009bd5c831e4762abe99b64a6e1877e
#: 32b092c2a351415ab86da46f93c5eb3f b8d6eb4bdbf14547bd2b967bec0edca4
#: f9342ad6c320456eaa4710a5a61a50d9
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:25 41b355e7691446299c3a88a2e2da2ddc
#: 93924df9fbf14c05a664e24a3caa8fec a1b5573d0bcf4d1fb471b2719b62798c
#: b177894d97f348cb88b55bce85b15bc6
msgid ""
"If the autopilot's Serial2 port (aka Telem2) is used then the following "
"parameters should be set:"
msgstr "如果使用飞控的 Serial2 端口（即 Telem2），则应设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:27 5c894263b9a94c41ad438f934ed1b588
#: ac21c7a72d12402595d8a1fc050b6c2c b9f154da628b486086c7bdfb0642fc6c
#: d1cd7139526e4578af486899575424af
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Rangefinder)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（测距仪）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:28 2f28e6372851489fa17405007095f4c6
#: 3ea874e2ef2044a5810e61f2158ae77e 74b3dfcc90a042fca24f66fa55e84924
#: a7164465ba434f5697392bef30a1585f
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 9 (9600 baud) to match the default baud"
" rate of the CEE-LINE.  This should be adjusted if the CEE-LINE config "
"changes."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 9（9600 波特），与 CEE-LINE 的默认波特率一致。如果 CEE-"
"LINE 配置改变，应相应调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:30 36ee90dd6ff44a8881f0a0766104f895
#: 6c0b680df23e432b974734b2a6babc65 822d21505d514c9da20291ccccbcbc7e
#: f5c4839203444b87ba1e954e260ca88a
msgid "These rangefinder parameters should also be set:"
msgstr "还应设置以下测距仪参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:32 4da1e9412c684c6baa9fefef475653a7
#: 6eb88552fdd54d0aaee261afa325f1b2 a8f8572822064e5eaf0acdb56913ce63
#: e07a032dc6714fc7b29963c43087492f
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17 (NMEA)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17（NMEA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:33 1770fce475d748e28d347b18b8859efa
#: 747f3687d41147ff8f16a5295eda9a95 d8a37f9fb5274eb68dc38039a5fde90d
#: e3f73f77a3b446babc5bbb8532a0c12d
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.50     - adjust if the CEE-LINE config "
"changes"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.50 —— 如果 CEE-LINE 配置改变则相应调整"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:34 44e089808c634d859fed236be8c1e18c
#: 69b3d97c8f314c41a4ac129b0fc4f8c9 9851a13f971f483f8c27b1357d31aa1c
#: df43163ac51147d2a63fcc84daf1426b
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 70 (70m) - adjust if the CEE-LINE config "
"changes"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 70（70 米）—— 如果 CEE-LINE 配置改变则相应调整"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:35 8e3e237125b44225ba75eb6f0b4f5d5e
#: b036f3fe3c42494d82f174895fc493d1 b28c946148404b1196edcb8a19b302b9
#: f14c8f0df1ca4d71a97e4f688b056971
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (down)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（向下）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:36 33f580db84ad4b94b2167cc563e1bdbc
#: 3d12d3f20d734a2d987d72484865fb14 3dd6aa4b4a014a6f9ec32cac4a0e8a8c
#: a3a8a11c3cb64093a4aa64074fe582cc
msgid ""
":ref:`FRAME_CLASS` = 2 (boat) - needed if you want the rangefinder reading "
"logged as `DPTH` (and this only works on rover)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FRAME_CLASS` = 2（船）—— 如果希望把测距仪读数以 `DPTH` 记入日志则需要设置（且仅在 Rover 上有效）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:39 3f9f80c7c09541f980e4836315056095
#: a2c734773c104ee48dc6c7937ac16a42 a71d68ffd48547e8bbceea6f569746b5
#: c8961bc9367f419facd57c8f58dbad5f
msgid "Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "高级配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:41 4380547274bf46d7979267e549fc4d62
#: d4e251a2a634466fb23205774956c48f d7b80aa6361047719aaa580d548d456a
#: df9c6c8a16fe4e12938559eed8af2b6a
msgid ""
"The CEE-LINE is capable of being configured for diverse operating "
"environments.  See the `CEE-LINE documentation "
"<https://ceehydrosystems.com/products/single-beam-echo-sounders/cee-"
"line/>`__ for instructions on adjusting these parameters via a PC connected "
"to the CEE-LINE with the USB cable.  Ardupilot is not capable of adjusting "
"these parameters itself but once they are set, they won't need to be changed"
" and the above configuration works with the CEE-LINE out of the box for "
"plug-and-play simplicity."
msgstr ""
"CEE-LINE 可以针对多种作业环境进行配置。请参阅 `CEE-LINE 文档 "
"<https://ceehydrosystems.com/products/single-beam-echo-sounders/cee-"
"line/>`__，了解如何通过 USB 线将 PC 连接到 CEE-LINE 来调整这些参数。ArduPilot "
"本身无法调整这些参数，但这些参数一经设定便无需再改，上述配置可让 CEE-LINE 开箱即用、即插即用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:44 1b1da2b22d7b48d9a3860f81de358bf9
#: 233155274a73426c86a717f63c712221 37004ea05c774a4f92c4e48a8f3e9c09
#: 7b168d7e5ccb4c16bec82e5e1c87156f
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:46 5d657125a5c14e09ac08527dc0e553a9
#: c47e617cb674426e9f7d3f6ef6ee9c24 dae68d10fad542c8b9c0eeeeb0acd29c
#: f7e3c7587fdb4051886adb5e608e3813
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:53 4a70cad8c8324344a3209b6e91f7ad2b
#: 94ec6e208694461bb1619786813e92c5 9f00be7b44e74049bf36603c9bef19c6
#: d8d8e2849e074b49a1919f1c1d2f2010
msgid "Example Results"
msgstr "结果示例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:55 1e27b9b74e2e4187a0e47a752cee76c2
#: 4f4fef14eb384e4687f56cd3ea1c3060 854a7599b454400098c36625a68f95e9
#: d368ae52dd2a4beb8a59101abd3e666e
msgid ""
"CEE-LINE data can be extracted directly from the binary logs and plotted "
"using whatever tool you like, for example with `GPS Visualizer "
"<https://www.gpsvisualizer.com/map_input>`__"
msgstr ""
"CEE-LINE 数据可以直接从二进制日志中提取，并用任意你喜欢的工具绘图，例如 `GPS Visualizer "
"<https://www.gpsvisualizer.com/map_input>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ceeline.rst:60 0215b84dcdb540a4a75a8776159beaa8
#: 8c9f392a13c94ed58b70ba13c2e40aa1 b87ac64a3b5b44a58f11a0e8b3b323e5
#: cf2eb3ae0e8c4268a4ba42fc55637fb8
msgid ""
"The examples here (GPS Visualizer above and Hydromagic below) were created "
"from data collected in a quick 30 minute survey done from the comfort and "
"safety of the shore."
msgstr ""
"这里的示例（上图 GPS Visualizer，下图 Hydromagic）来自一次在岸上舒适安全地完成的约 30 分钟快速测绘所采集的数据。"
